node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Brand data must NEVER live in this repository.
#
# The engine is public and forkable; your voice is private. Keeping them in
# separate trees is what makes a pull request safe by construction — your
# personas are not "excluded", they are simply not here.
#
# Run `voicepack lint --privacy` before pushing. It verifies this.
#
# NOTE: these patterns are root-anchored (`/profiles/`) on purpose. The
# unanchored form also matches examples/demo/profiles/, which silently excludes
# the committed fixture — and the fixture is what lets CI validate a pull
# request without access to anyone's private profiles. The test suite asserts
# the fixture stays tracked, because this failure is invisible until someone
# clones the repo and finds CI has nothing to run against.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/profiles/
/captures/
/candidates/
/persona/
/learnings/
*.raw.json
*.candidate.json

# Generated caches
**/index.json
